WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.524
Bu qo‘shimcha modul, u tasdiqlangan ma’ruza soatlariga kirmaydi, lekin dasturdagi mustaqil ishlar uchun kerak.

2
00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:14.568
Laplas almashtirishi differensial tenglamani algebraik tenglamaga aylantiradi.

3
00:00:14.568 --> 00:00:20.534
Bugun uning ta’rifini, jadvalini va boshlang‘ich masalani yechishni ko‘ramiz.

4
00:00:20.784 --> 00:00:27.516
F katta s teng noldan cheksizgacha e daraja minus s t karra f t d t integrali.

5
00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:35.542
Integral mavjud bo‘lishi uchun f bo‘lakli uzluksiz va eksponensial tartibli bo‘lishi yetarli.

6
00:00:35.542 --> 00:00:42.446
Masalan, e daraja a t ning tasviri bir bo‘lingan s minus a, s katta a bo‘lganda.

7
00:00:42.696 --> 00:00:48.683
Asosiy xossa: hosilaning tasviri s karra Y minus y nolda.

8
00:00:48.683 --> 00:00:55.615
Ikkinchi hosila: s kvadrat Y minus s y nolda minus y shtrix nolda.

9
00:00:55.615 --> 00:01:06.854
Masala: y ikki shtrix minus uch y shtrix plyus ikki y teng e daraja uch t, y nolda bir, y shtrix nolda nol.

10
00:01:07.104 --> 00:01:15.184
Y ni topamiz: surat s kvadrat minus olti s plyus o‘n, maxraj s minus bir, s minus ikki,

11
00:01:15.184 --> 00:01:17.413
s minus uch ko‘paytmasi.

12
00:01:17.413 --> 00:01:25.214
Sodda kasrlarga ajratamiz: koeffitsiyentlar besh ikkidan, minus ikki va bir ikkidan.

13
00:01:25.464 --> 00:01:34.291
Jadval bo‘yicha qaytamiz: y teng besh ikkidan e daraja t minus ikki e daraja ikki t plyus bir ikkidan e daraja uch t.

14
00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:39.723
Tekshiruv: t nolda besh ikkidan minus ikki plyus bir ikkidan bir beradi.

15
00:01:39.723 --> 00:01:43.118
O‘zgarmaslarni alohida topish kerak bo‘lmadi.

16
00:01:43.368 --> 00:01:49.297
Grafikda yechim: boshida y bir va gorizontal urinma bilan boshlanadi,

17
00:01:49.297 --> 00:01:54.710
so‘ng e daraja uch t hadi ustunlik qiladi va yechim tez o‘sadi.

18
00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:58.703
Savol: y shtrixning Laplas tasviri nimaga teng?

19
00:01:58.703 --> 00:02:02.287
Videoni to‘xtating, javobni o‘zingiz tanlang,

20
00:02:02.287 --> 00:02:07.862
so‘ng izohni o‘qing va kerak bo‘lsa darsning tegishli qismiga qayting.
